modifying the code.

00:02:16.957 --> 00:02:17.540
Which is cool.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:18.950
MARK MANDEL: Which
is super cool.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.912
I'm going to steal
a phrase that I

00:02:20.912 --> 00:02:22.370
